--
-- 助手管理台七页的文字说明，以及模型那一页——每页挂一条 AssistantPageNote。
--
-- 上游把这些页面交出来时不带任何说明：字段标签就是全部文字，而其中几个光看标签不够（`模型标识` 看着像
-- 显示名，实际是发给模型服务的那串名字）。文字本体住在覆盖层的
-- `src/views/keelbase/assistant/AssistantPageNote.vue` 里，本补丁只负责把它挂上去——故改措辞只改那一处，
-- 这里八行不用动。
--
-- 每页两处：`<script setup>` 之后加一条 import，模板里加一个元素。七页放在 `<template>` 之后（整页级提示，
-- 正好在内容卡片之上）；**会话页例外**——那是一套全高的聊天布局，内容之上没有放整块提示的地方，故它的说明
-- 走紧凑模式、放进右侧标题栏。
--
-- 与其它补丁同理：应用不上就响亮失败。上游挪动 `<template>` 或 `</el-header>` 的位置，这里就会报出来。
--
-- The assistant console's seven pages, plus the model page, each mounting an AssistantPageNote.
--
-- Upstream ships these pages without a word of explanation: the field labels are all the text there is, and
-- several of them do not say enough on their own (`模型标识` reads like a display name; it is the string sent
-- to the model service). The prose itself lives in the overlay, at
-- `src/views/keelbase/assistant/AssistantPageNote.vue` — this patch only mounts it, so a wording change is one
-- edit over there and these eight hunks stay put.
--
-- Two insertions per page: an import after `<script setup>`, and the element in the template. Seven go right
-- after `<template>` (a page-level note, above the content cards); **the session page is the exception** — it
-- is a full-height chat layout with no room for a block above the content, so it uses the compact rendering
-- inside the right-hand header.
--
-- Same rule as the other patches: a section that no longer applies fails loudly rather than being skipped.

